ro_title:"Vogel",hero_subtitle:"Family Travel",hero_description1:"We are a travel operator creating tailormade journeys for clients with high requirements for service, privacy, and details. We work with non-standard requests and take full responsibility for organizing the trip — from the idea to the return.",hero_description2:"Vogel Family Travel is a closed circle of people for whom travel is part of a lifestyle and an expression of inner freedom. We combine an international level of service with attentiveness and Ukrainian hospitality.",expertise_title:"Our Expertise",expertise_description:"Premium and private formats: villa, chalet, chateau and castle rentals, private jet flights, yacht routes, and intimate events abroad. Logistics, accommodation, transfers — we control everything.",philosophy_title:"Vogel Philosophy",philosophy_description:'The name Vogel ("bird") reflects our approach: freedom of choice and flexibility of routes. Like a bird in the sky, you decide where to move, and we ensure that this path is as comfortable as possible.',reasons_title:"Six Reasons",reasons_subtitle:"to book with us",reason1_title:"Turnkey Trip Control",reason1_description:"We take care of all decisions, logistics, and route changes — from the first idea to the return home. You don't manage the process, you get the result.",reason2_title:"Access to Terms and Privileges",reason2_description:"Thanks to direct contracts and partnerships, our clients receive better accommodation terms, upgrades, bonuses, and special rates.",reason3_title:"Tailormade Itineraries",reason3_description:`We design trips based on the client's life rhythm: without unnecessary transfers, haste, or "compulsory" points. Especially for families and complex formats.`,reason4_title:"Predictable Result",reason4_description:"You always understand the budget, deadlines, and format of the trip. We don't sell anything extra and don't change the rules in the process.",reason5_title:"Personal Support",reason5_descript